{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graviscape is a chill, physics-based puzzle game where you pilot a small ship through strange gravitational landscapes. Use the pull of planets and the push of your thrusters to find your way through handcrafted levels set deep in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no timer. No score. Just your ship, the stars, and the strange forces that guide you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, your AI companion offers fragments of a forgotten mystery\u2014both out there in space, and within.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608000?t=1773947629","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608000?t=1773947629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608000/162bac0e40951a7ddac275ab2f06f4bb95646159/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773947629","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608000/162bac0e40951a7ddac275ab2f06f4bb95646159/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773947629","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graviscape is a chill, physics-based puzzle game where you pilot a small ship through strange gravitational landscapes. Use the pull of planets and the push of your thrusters to find your way through handcrafted levels set deep in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no timer. No score. Just your ship, the stars, and the strange forces that guide you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, your AI companion offers fragments of a forgotten myster